meta {
  name: saveManufacturer
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveManufacturer",
    "params": {
      "manufacturer_name": "Acme Corp",
      "company_name": "Acme Corporation",
      "country_code": "NL"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update a manufacturer

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `manufacturer_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the manufacturer; omit to create a new manufacturer |
  | `external_manufacturer_id` | string (nullable) | no | Your system's reference ID for the manufacturer |
  | `manufacturer_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the manufacturer |
  | `company_name` | string (nullable) | no | Registered company name |
  | `company_name_2` | string (nullable) | no | Second line of the company name |
  | `address` | string (nullable) | no | Street address |
  | `city` | string (nullable) | no | City |
  | `postal_code` | string (nullable) | no | Postal or ZIP code |
  | `country_code` | string (nullable) | no | ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code |
  | `gln` | string (nullable) | no | Global Location Number (GS1 GLN, 13 digits) |
  | `manufacturer_image_base64` | string (nullable) | no | Base64-encoded logo image for the manufacturer |

  **Example: Create a manufacturer**. Omit manufacturer_id to create; provide it to update.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveManufacturer",
    "params": {
      "manufacturer_name": "Acme Corp",
      "company_name": "Acme Corporation",
      "country_code": "NL"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "manufacturer_id": 10
  }
  ```
}
